# --ui-input for flip_select.input at 1280x720: clicks routed like live input (widgets first).
# Ordermenu "Fire at will" cell, left click: cycles to Hold fire.
10 press 309 87
11 release 309 87
# Gridmenu armmex cell (50 / 500), left click: picks the blueprint.
15 press 35 170
16 release 35 170
# Ground in front of the commander: places it.
20 press 760 200
21 release 760 200
# Pick armmex again, then right click on the ground: cancels the placement, no order.
25 press 35 170
26 release 35 170
28 rclick 760 200
# Ordermenu "Hold pos" cell, left click: cycles the move state to Maneuver.
30 press 377 87
31 release 377 87
